---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
			description="About Autophagy: who it's for, what it tracks, and why."
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>About Autophagy</h1>
			<p>
				Autophagy is a practitioner's site on the five practices most reliably associated with
				autophagy in human studies: fasting, exercise, cold immersion, sauna, and hypoxic
				breathing. It is written for over-40 functional-fitness athletes who want to keep
				training hard and ageing well.
			</p>
			<p>
				Nothing here is medical advice. The aim is to gather what the evidence actually
				supports, describe how it fits into a real week of training, and stay honest about
				what is settled and what isn't.
			</p>
			<p>
				The companion iOS app of the same name is in development. It logs the five practices,
				ingests HRV, sleep, resting heart rate, and VO2 max from Apple Health, and surfaces
				the combinations that correlate with your own numbers. Sign-up for launch will be
				announced here when the app reaches TestFlight.
			</p>
			<p>
				Run by <a href="https://github.com/neilstanley">Neil Stanley</a>.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
